flowchart TD
  Open([Ticket opened]) --> Triage[Initial triage]
  Triage --> Known{Known issue?}
  Known -->|yes| Fix[Apply known fix]
  Fix --> Resolved{Customer satisfied?}
  Resolved -->|yes| Close([Ticket closed])
  Resolved -->|no| Escalate[Escalate to specialist]
  Escalate --> Investigate[Deep investigation]
  Investigate --> Fix
  Known -->|no| Investigate
  KB[(Knowledge base)] -.-> Known
  SLA[(SLA timer)] -.-> Triage

  %% @main Open Triage Known Fix Resolved Close
  %% @retry Escalate -> Investigate
  %% @side KB SLA
